{"ID":"20240118151421-4mvh8e9","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240118151421-4mvh8e9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151421-4mvh8e9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151421-e5ijcaw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119141624-tin9ivm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119141624-tin9ivm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:119,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:119\u0026#125;","title":"017白青","type":"doc","updated":"20240125105111"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151421-e5ijcaw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151421-e5ijcaw","updated":"20240119141623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘平，主明目利九窍，耳聋心下邪气令人吐，杀诸毒三虫。久服通神明，轻身延年不老。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119141623-ncmf4d0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119141623-ncmf4d0"}},{"ID":"20240119141624-tin9ivm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119141624-tin9ivm","updated":"20240125105111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第十七种，这个药名白青，这个白青现在已经绝迹很少用了，在《神农本草经》里有记载，味甘平，主明目利九窍，这种金石类的药，比如说空青、白青、曾青，都是产在铜矿坑里面。所以如果我们去找白青，我去找就可以找的出来，那个空青么、曾青么，你都认得，像出来是白色的，这个在铜坑里面，是白青，现在用的不多，所以大家看一下，我们后面也没有注解很多，一般的本草上面也没有写。"}]}]}